  "description": "Alibaba Qwen provider for Mythosia.AI. Adds QwenService for DashScope, vLLM, and Ollama chat-completion endpoints, with streaming token usage, reasoning controls, custom deployment names, and ordered multi-function calls. Chat only; image generation is not supported. Requires Mythosia.AI 7.0.0.",
