  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 is a breaking release for Mythosia.AI 7.0.0. Qwen non-streaming and streaming paths now preserve ordered function-call/result batches and use the shared sequential or bounded-parallel handler dispatcher. Removes the unsupported legacy image-method overrides; Qwen remains chat only and does not implement IImageGenerationService. Full notes and migration guide: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/core/Mythosia.AI.Providers.Alibaba/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v200",
